                <input type="checkbox" id="toggle-plus-minus" checked style="width: 18px; height: 18px; cursor: pointer;">
                Include Plus &amp; Minus Letter Grades (e.g. A- = 3.7, B+ = 3.3)
              </label>
              <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-secondary); display: block; margin-top: 0.25rem;">Uncheck for standard whole letter grades (A = 4.0, B = 3.0, C = 2.0).</span>
            </div>
          </div>

